# Visual (Gila Store)

Wordmark in the UI: **Gila Store**. Tokens stay `--paper` / `--moss` / `--clay` so we do **not** copy Pinterest red. Clicking the wordmark goes home; do not duplicate that with a Shop nav item.

Tokens (already in `src/styles.css`): `--paper #f3eee6`, `--pin #fffdf8`, `--ink #1c1814`, `--moss #2f5d50`, `--clay #c45c26`. Rounded cards (`--radius`), soft shadow, image-first cards.

- Catalog: equal-height **CSS grid** (`.product-grid`), not masonry/`column-count`. **2 columns ~375px / max 6 desktop**. Square photo (`aspect-ratio: 1`), title/price/qty/button on fixed rows so a row of cards lines up. Search above the grid; filters packed right. **Add to cart** under the title. Title clamps to 2 lines.
- Product image: Flickr via loremflickr using **name** (or category if the name is junk/XSS). Same SKU → same photo (`lock`). If that 404s, picsum seed, then initials. Never broken-image icons.
- Type: Helvetica/system, English copy, `$` via `Intl`. Visible `:focus-visible`.
- Admin can be denser (forms/tables) but same tokens. Catalog usable ~375px.

```text
❌ Red CTA, dense product table on the shop home, unlabeled qty
✅ Moss pill buttons, equal grid cards, "5 available" next to a clamped qty
```
